+2. Set `Z_MR_DIFF_CHUNK_BYTES=1` to force per-chunk mode regardless of actual diff size.
+3. Run `/z-mr-review`.
+4. Expected outcome:
+   - `archive/$RUN/chunks/` contains one `.patch` file per modified file plus `manifest.json`.
